1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,570
Mom only asks that I stay
safe and healthy now.

2
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:06,730
It used to include "happy."

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,830
Now: safe. Healthy.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,170
She says: as for happiness,

5
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:15,970
what makes me happy
might not make you happy.

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,600
We cannot agree on that.

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,900
So let us stick to
safe and healthy.
